OL,3,GNEWSACCTV images released of suspect in
OL,4,Ataxi driver shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FCCTV images of a suspect thought to be
OL,7,Finvolved in the attempted murder of a
OL,8,Ftaxi driver in west Belfast last year
OL,9,Fhave been released by the police.
OL,11,FSean O'Reilly was shot twice as he sat
OL,12,Finside his car in the Bell Steel Manor
OL,13,Farea on 23 February.
OL,15,FA reward of #20,000 has been offered
OL,16,Ffrom the charity Crimestoppers as
OL,17,Fdetectives from the Police Service of
OL,18,FNorthern Ireland's (PSNI) major
OL,19,Finvestigation team reiterated their
OL,20,Fappeal for information.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
