OL,3,GNEWSACCTV images released of suspect in
OL,4,Ataxi driver shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FDescribing the attack as "targeted and
OL,7,Fcold-blooded", Det Insp Jack Kelly
OL,8,Furged the public not to "speculate
OL,9,Fabout the man's identity".
